},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\nv4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\nv4.7.dev1.official [bf95b6258]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe replace button doesn't highlight the next occurrence, \nand the matches counter shows: 0 of 4 matches\nexpected: 1 of 4 matches\n\nWhat works:\nThe highlight and matches counter works, when pressing `enter` when the replace input box is focused. However, this method has another issue as reported here:\nReplace (ctrl + r) requires pressing enter twice https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116975\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open the project: issue-replace-button-doesn't-highlight-next-occurrence.zip\n- open `node_2d.gd` in the script editor\n- left mouse click on the first line\n- press: `ctrl + f`\n- type: `abc`\n- press: `ctrl + r`\n- type: `x`\n- left click on the button: Replace\n- as expected the first occurrence of 'abc' was replaced with 'x'\n- issue, the second occurrence isn't selected and the find bar's matches counter says: 0 of 4 matches\n- left clicking on the button again: Replace\n- as expected it replaces the second occurrence\n- issue, the third occurrence isn't selected and the matches counter says: 0 of 3 matches\n\nExpected: the next occurrence should be highlighted to show what will be replaced when the button is pressed, and the matches counter should be correct.\n\nLeft clicking to focus the replace input box and pressing `enter` works, it highlights the next occurrence and shows the correct matches counter.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[issue-replace-button-doesn't-highlight-next-occurrence.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25693808/issue-replace-button-doesn.t-highlight-next-occurrence.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116978/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}